    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to represent the sale of 137 Grange Abbey Crescent, Donaghmede, a well-presented three-bedroom semi-detached family home ideally positioned within this mature and highly sought-after residential development.\n\nThe property is presented in good condition throughout and offers well-proportioned accommodation, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families and those looking to downsize. The property also benefits from valuable side access and a low-maintenance rear garden, providing an excellent outdoor space with minimal upkeep required.\n\nThe accommodation extends to approximately 926 sq. ft. and comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, living room, kitchen/dining room, three bedrooms and a family bathroom. To the rear is a private, low-maintenance garden with a westerly aspect and walled boundaries, while the side access adds further convenience.\n\nThe location is excellent, situated just off the Grange Road and within easy reach of a wide range of local amenities. Donaghmede Shopping Centre, Clare Hall Shopping Centre and the Odeon Cinema are all close by, while there is an excellent choice of schools in the surrounding area. Transport links are also well catered for, with the DART and Dublin Bus routes 15 and 29A accessible nearby, providing convenient access to the city centre and surrounding areas.\n\nNo. 137 Grange Abbey Crescent represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-maintained family home in a popular and established residential location, with all the amenities of Donaghmede and beyond on its doorstep."
      },
